  "details": "FOMO sucks, and it kind of feels like with these drops we’re heading to like. Game sponsored FOMO almost. Like this is a big social platform and it’s impossible to not miss out on things but like. Missing out on spawnable/deployable stuff that is sort of artificially scarce feels kinda bad. \n\nFor brand deals such as the big screen beyond item, it makes sense not to have it be purchasable again once the promotion ends, but for something such as the bubble blaster or these stickers, I think it’d be nice to allow folks to use VRChat credits to claim items after they’ve run their course and are otherwise unobtainable.  \n\nMaybe even have it be like “it’s summer 2026, we have this fresh pack of stuff for y’all, and you can for a limited time get our previous year’s stuff in the store for credits”\n\nOr otherwise add some other way to receive these items.",
